---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import ResearchCard from '../../components/ResearchCard.astro'; import ResearchMap from '../../components/ResearchMap.astro'; import ConferencePhoto from '../../components/ConferencePhoto.astro'; import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; import {profile} from '../../data/profile'; const projects=(await getCollection('research')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
---
<BaseLayout lang="zh" title="孙红亮 | 住房政策与城市治理" switchHref="/"><section class="wrap hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">博士研究生 · 公共管理</div><h1 style="font-family:var(--zh-serif)">孙红亮<span style="font-family:var(--serif)">Hongliang Sun</span></h1><p>{profile.roleZh}<br/>{profile.schoolZh}</p><p class="lead">住房从不只是居所。它关乎土地、记忆、财富与归属，也构成政治生活的安静结构。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/zh/research/">探索研究</a><a class="button" href="/cv/">查看简历</a><a class="button" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>联系</a></div></div><ConferencePhoto/></section><section class="section constellation-section"><div class="wrap constellation-grid"><div><span class="kicker">研究星图</span><h2>土地、住房与公共生活</h2></div><ResearchMap/></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">01 / 研究</span><div><h2>精选研究</h2><p class="muted">{profile.researchLineZh}</p></div></div><div class="cards">{projects.map((p,i)=><ResearchCard entry={p} index={i+1} lang="zh"/>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="narrow"><span class="kicker">02 / 研究主线</span><h2>制度也被写入城市空间。</h2><p class="lead">我的研究关注住房制度如何重塑不平等、地方治理和政治参与，以及大规模公共干预如何改变居住方式、社区关系与居民对公共机构的参与。</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
